---
/* Component — PageNav
 * The primary navigation of the page's top bar.
 *
 * Renders <nav> so the region is announced as a navigation landmark — unlike
 * the brand and actions regions, its content is always navigation, so the
 * element is fixed rather than opt-in.
 *
 * Claims grid column 2 of PageHeader's `1fr auto 1fr` track list explicitly.
 * Because the two outer columns are equal fractions, column 2 sits at the bar's
 * centre regardless of whether either sibling region is present.
 *
 * justify-content: center centres the region's own content within the column,
 * which matters only when something else stretches the column. */
---

<nav>
  <slot />
</nav>

<style>
  nav {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--bravoixr-spacing-3);
  }
</style>
